  "attribution": "Adamson, S.J. et al. (2010). An Improved Brief Measure of Cannabis Misuse: The CUDIT-R. Drug and Alcohol Dependence, 110, 137–143.",
  "interpretationNote": "Supplied form states 8+ as hazardous cannabis use and 12+ as possible cannabis use disorder; both require clinical follow-up and neither is diagnostic."
